<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SUMMARY IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of  Spanish first division match on Monday:</p>
<p>Hercules 3 (Flavio Maestri 57, Marcos Martin, own goal 59, Manuel Alfaro 90) Sevilla 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance 17,000.</p>
